OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled at UK
OL,4,Aairports as air traffic control issue
OL,5,Acauses widespread disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FRyanair says 65,000 of its passengers
OL,8,Fhave been delayed by up to eight hours
OL,9,Fwhile British Airways warns of a
OL,10,F"significant knock-on impact for
OL,11,Fcustomers and colleagues"
OL,13,F"Technicians have identified the issue
OL,14,Fand are fixing it as we speak,"
OL,15,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,16,Fsays in a statement on X
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
